{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Etiquette Elegance</i> \u2014 a temple of refinement and impeccable service. Tailor the dishes to your guests' tastes, set the tables to perfection, and create an atmosphere of exquisite elegance. But beware: the slightest mistake and perfection will be lost. Can you achieve perfection and become a legend of the gastronomic club?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Graceful table setting</strong> \u2013 Arrange the cutlery correctly, keep the table in order, and follow all the nuances of restaurant etiquette</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/Chaos.gif?t=1743619623\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Absurdly picky guests</strong> \u2013 Each visitor has their own tastes, habits, and quirks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/Personality.png?t=1743619623\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dishes beyond time and space</strong> \u2013 Over 70 menu items created from a variety of ingredients</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/Dishes.png?t=1743619623\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Daily chaos</strong> \u2013 Unexpected challenges make each level special</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/Night.jpg?t=1743619623\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylish retro-futuristic setting</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in the elegant atmosphere of a classic restaurant of the future</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/Guests.png?t=1743619623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Etiquette Elegance</strong> is a test of your memory and attentiveness, where every detail counts. Join us and discover the amazing world of true elegance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*The etiquette of this establishment is an art that exists by its own special rules. Any resemblance to real life is purely coincidental \u2013 don\u2019t even think about trying this in a high-end restaurant!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538500?t=1743619623","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538500?t=1743619623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/21d86d26dc8ba48b217aeb2743123b59ddb22c30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743619623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/21d86d26dc8ba48b217aeb2743123b59ddb22c30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743619623","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Etiquette Elegance</i> \u2014 a temple of refinement and impeccable service. Tailor the dishes to your guests' tastes, set the tables to perfection, and create an atmosphere of exquisite elegance. But beware: the slightest mistake and perfection will be lost. Can you achieve perfection and become a legend of the gastronomic club?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong